    fix(harness): ticket new reads the request's YAML frontmatter; its title becomes the ticket title, and a header that does not parse is refused before anything is written
    
    Request files imported from issues carry a title/labels header. An unquoted title containing ': '
    is not valid YAML; nine store requests (T-0001..T-0013) were imported that way and only failed
    later, in an editor preview. The header was never read: the title came from the first # heading,
    else the file name.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01M2pc3NWmnJtLxmKPJc9c8a

